## Implementation Notes

- **Query syntax**: Use Gmail search operators (`label:"Input/Java" is:unread`)
- **MIME parsing**: Gmail API returns base64url-encoded parts
  - Decode with: `Buffer.from(data, 'base64url').toString('utf-8')`
- **Content priority**: HTML > plain text (HTML needed for content extraction)
- **Label extraction**: Parse "Input/Java" → "Java" (split on "/" and take second part)
- **Error handling**: If one label fails, log and continue with others (don't stop batch)
- **Pagination**: Not needed if maxPerLabel kept small (5-10)

